\title{AACclust: Affinity Contraction Agglomerative Clustering for Categorical Data}
\description{
Implements the Affinity Contraction Agglomerative Clustering (AAC) algorithm for categorical data, along with the Quality Index (QI) for partition quality assessment. The AAC algorithm operates on exact attribute matching and mutual affinity edge contractions, avoiding dependency on initial medoids. A parallel optimization framework (Fork-Join model) efficiently searches for the optimal number of clusters.
